dc5aea1d2b7b55.mp4?t=1709800578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Experience a whole new dimension to fighting crime with our season feature! Every month, progress through a new season pass that unlocks exclusive armour, weapons, and sidekicks themed around Season Arcs. These narrative and thematic elements tie together three seasons lasting a three-month period, creating a new layer of depth and strategy in Hero Zero.<br><br>PvE FEATURE: For the toughest of heroes, 'Hard Mode' has arrived in Hero Zero! With this PvE feature, users who have reached the upper ranks of heroism can replay special missions on a tougher mode. Track your progress against other players with our leaderboard, and earn great rewards for defeating the biggest and baddest enemies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/482920/extras/fb9ca168a7ab71188a00e9332326eeb5.poster.avif?t=1709800578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/482920/extras/fb9ca168a7ab71188a00e9332326eeb5.webm?t=1709800578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/482920/extras/fb9ca168a7ab71188a00e9332326eeb5.mp4?t=1709800578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>- Over 31 million players worldwide!<br>- Regular free updates and new content to keep the game fresh<br>- Free to play - no cost to join the fun!<br>- Create and customize your own hero to suit your playstyle<br>- Build up your own superhero team to take on any challenge!<br>- Challenge other heroes in PvP and team battles for bragging rights<br>- Funny and fascinating storyline to keep you engaged<br>- Easy to learn gameplay for players of all skill levels<br>- Appealing graphics to bring the world to life<br>- Real time villain events with thousands of players for an epic experience<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/482920/extras/5834679aada750782d20e26fab8658ba.poster.avif?t=1709800578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/482920/extras/5834679aada750782d20e26fab8658ba.webm?t=1709800578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/482920/extras/5834679aada750782d20e26fab8658ba.mp4?t=1709800578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Start your epic and hilarious adventure now - for free! Join the millions of players already enjoying the fun and excitement of this game.<br><br>Want to be a part of our community? Questions, problems, or suggestions?<br><br>You can find us on:<br>- Discord: <br>- Instagram: <br>- Facebook: <br>- YouTube: ",
